  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d55b0a39c66bb4ec2b0cd46ed4284a84c2cbbff8deb9ea71b4ba717ff29f1d25.png] \n\nGiven equation (14 + 24) - 54 ÷ 15 × 4 + 59 – (2 + 29) = 9 × 5 + 3\n\n**Option 1 → **4 and 3\n\n(14 + 24) - 54 ÷ 15 × 3 + 59 – (2 + 29) = 9 × 5 + 4\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n38 - 54 ÷ 15 × 3 + 59 – 31 = 9 × 5 + 4\n\n38 – 3.6 × 3 + 59 – 31 = 9 × 5 + 4\n\n38 – 10.8 + 59 – 31 = 45 + 4\n\n97 – 10.8 – 31 = 45 + 4\n\n97 - 41.8 = 49\n\n55.2 = 49 **(LHS **≠ **RHS)**\n\n**Option 2** **→** 24 and 15\n\n**(14 + 15) - 54 ÷ 24 × 4 + 59 – (2 + 29) = 9 × 5 + 3**\n\n**29 - 54 ÷ 24 × 4 + 59 – 31 = 9 × 5 + 3**\n\n**29 – 2.25 × 4 + 59 – 31 = 9 × 5 + 3**\n\n**29 – 9 + 59 – 31 = 45 + 3**\n\n**29 – 9 + 59 – 31 = 45 + 3**\n\n**88 – 9 – 31 = 45 + 3**\n\n**88 - 40 = 48**\n\n**48 = 48 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 3** **→** 59 and 54\n\n(14 + 24) - 59 ÷ 15 × 4 + 54 – (2 + 29) = 9 × 5 + 3\n\n38 - 59 ÷ 15 × 4 + 54 – 31 = 9 × 5 +3\n\n38 – 3.68 × 4 + 54 – 31 = 9 × 5 +3\n\n38 – 3.68 × 4 + 54 – 31 = 9 × 5 +3\n\n38 – 14.75 + 54 – 31 = 45 + 3\n\n92 – 14.75 – 31 = 48\n\n92 - 45.75 = 48\n\n46.25 = 48** (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\n**Option 4** **→** 29 and 4\n\n(14 + 24) - 54 ÷ 15 × 29 + 59 – (2 + 4) = 9 × 5 + 3\n\n38 - 54 ÷ 15 × 29 + 59 – 6= 9 × 5 + 3\n\n38 – 3.6 × 29 + 59 – 6= 9 × 5 + 3\n\n38 – 104.4 + 59 – 6= 45 + 3\n\n38 – 104.4 + 59 – 6= 45 + 3\n\n97 – 104.4 – 6 = 48\n\n-13.4 = 48** (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****24 and 15”**",
